          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni aloma ali, “Ekesia ali ali omundu owolaana, mbaao akhaba lichuune liewe lilala lilakwa asi tawe, ne bumayaanu bwanyoolekhana mu niye, alafwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
