              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami Solomoni arumania barusia Atonicha khukhwama khu alutare. Atonicha acha khu mwami mala asikama ebweeni wo mwami Solomoni, mala omwami amuboolela ali, “Khoche engo wowo.”",
          "type": "text",
